{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in an infinite loop inside a movie theater trying to reach the right screening room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird anomalies will occur. <i>Spot them</i>, run to get a new ticket, and keep going.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If your guess is right, you get closer to your movie room.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you get it wrong, you go back a few numbers\u2014unless you've stacked enough correct guesses to earn a shield in the cinema loyalty program.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.poster.avif?t=1757665061\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.webm?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.mp4?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INCLUDED IN THIS DEMO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough anomalies for more than a single play session. Approximate playtime: 25 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it as many times as you want to uncover all the demo anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the core mechanics and the beginning of the story.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO OMNIPLEX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Screening is a first-person horror anomaly-finding game set in a cinema venue. You will play as Susie, a movie fanatic who has just gotten her ticket to watch a film she\u2019s been eagerly awaiting for. Use your finest perception skills to help Susie make it to her film. The first run we guarantee your safety; after that, you are on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.poster.avif?t=1757665061\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.webm?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.mp4?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TERROR AWAITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every scare comes from the screen. Monsters, weird voices, blood... You better watch out because it's all coming for you.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.poster.avif?t=1757665061\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.webm?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.mp4?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY DETAIL MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trick is keeping your sanity whilst doing so. A big scare is not always a jump scare. Notice the subtle shifts or Susie may never make it to her seat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT ON HORROR LEGACY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Screening is inspired by find-anomalies games that present liminal spaces and psychological horror walking simulators, like '<i>The Exit 8</i>', '<i>The Cabin Factory'</i>, '<i>Hospital 666'</i>, and the old goodie <i>'P.T.'.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004700?t=1757665061","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004700?t=1757665061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/a7f0b461d3f8d8cf8b91d80431328c708536bff1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757665061","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/a7f0b461d3f8d8cf8b91d80431328c708536bff1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757665061","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological themes including trauma, death, depression, and self-harm. Players will encounter disturbing imagery, unsettling audio (such as child laughter in eerie contexts), and moments of emotional intensity. The narrative explores loss, memory, identity, and inner conflict through a surreal, cinematic lens. Dialogue and scenes may allude to overdose, suicide, and mental breakdowns, presented in a metaphorical and symbolic environment."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in an infinite loop inside a movie theater trying to reach the right screening room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird anomalies will occur. <i>Spot them</i>, run to get a new ticket, and keep going.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If your guess is right, you get closer to your movie room.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you get it wrong, you go back a few numbers\u2014unless you've stacked enough correct guesses to earn a shield in the cinema loyalty program.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.poster.avif?t=1757665061\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.webm?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.mp4?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INCLUDED IN THIS DEMO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough anomalies for more than a single play session. Approximate playtime: 25 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it as many times as you want to uncover all the demo anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the core mechanics and the beginning of the story.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO OMNIPLEX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Screening is a first-person horror anomaly-finding game set in a cinema venue. You will play as Susie, a movie fanatic who has just gotten her ticket to watch a film she\u2019s been eagerly awaiting for. Use your finest perception skills to help Susie make it to her film. The first run we guarantee your safety; after that, you are on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.poster.avif?t=1757665061\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.webm?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.mp4?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TERROR AWAITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every scare comes from the screen. Monsters, weird voices, blood... You better watch out because it's all coming for you.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.poster.avif?t=1757665061\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.webm?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004700/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.mp4?t=1757665061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY DETAIL MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trick is keeping your sanity whilst doing so. A big scare is not always a jump scare. Notice the subtle shifts or Susie may never make it to her seat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT ON HORROR LEGACY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Screening is inspired by find-anomalies games that present liminal spaces and psychological horror walking simulators, like '<i>The Exit 8</i>', '<i>The Cabin Factory'</i>, '<i>Hospital 666'</i>, and the old goodie <i>'P.T.'.</i></p>","developers":["Manguezal"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3632740","name":"The Last Screening"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store